---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RealtorCRM | CRM for Real Estate Agents"
  description="RealtorCRM helps real estate agents manage buyer and seller leads, import contacts from CSV, Excel, or Google Sheets, track deals, and automate Gmail or Outlook follow-ups. Free during early access."
  canonical="https://everyrealestatecalculator.com/real-estate-crm/"
  currentNav="crm"
  extraStyles={["realtorcrm.css"]}
>
<main id="main" class="realtoros-page">
  <section class="rc-hero" aria-labelledby="product-title">
    <div class="wrap rc-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">REALTORCRM · BUILT FOR REAL ESTATE AGENTS</span>
        <h1 id="product-title">Keep every lead, deal, and follow-up in one place.</h1>
        <p class="rc-lede">Manage buyers, sellers, listings, deals, and automated email follow-ups from one organized workspace — so nothing slips through the cracks.</p>
        <div class="rc-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#access" data-crm-link="signup" aria-describedby="hero-access-note">Get Started with RealtorCRM</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#features">Explore Features</a>
        </div>
        <p class="product-caption" id="hero-access-note">Free during early access — sign up securely in the RealtorCRM app.</p>
        <ul class="rc-trust">
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.2" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8.4 12.4l2.4 2.4 4.8-5.2"/></svg>Buyer &amp; Seller workspaces</li>
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.2" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8.4 12.4l2.4 2.4 4.8-5.2"/></svg>Gmail &amp; Outlook sending</li>
          <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.2" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8.4 12.4l2.4 2.4 4.8-5.2"/></svg>Built for realtors</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="rc-media">
        <div class="rc-media-frame" role="img" aria-label="RealtorCRM product demo"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rc-features" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">ESSENTIAL TOOLS</span>
      <h2 id="features-title">Everything you need between the first inquiry and closing.</h2>
      <div class="rc-cards">
        <a class="rc-card rc-card-link" href="#lead-deal-management">
          <span class="rc-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.4"/><path d="M3.6 19.2c.7-3 2.8-4.6 5.4-4.6s4.7 1.6 5.4 4.6"/><path d="M15.5 5.4a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 0 5.9M18.3 14.9c1.2.8 2 2 2.4 3.7"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Contacts</h3>
          <p>Organize buyers, sellers, and investors with stage, temperature, and activity history.</p>
          <span class="rc-card-cue" aria-hidden="true">See lead workspace &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="rc-card rc-card-link" href="#lead-deal-management">
          <span class="rc-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7.8" width="18" height="12.2" rx="2"/><path d="M9 7.8V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v1.8M3 12.8h18"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Deals</h3>
          <p>Track active opportunities across pipeline stages, link properties, and forecast commission.</p>
          <span class="rc-card-cue" aria-hidden="true">See deal pipeline &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="rc-card rc-card-link" href="#how-it-works">
          <span class="rc-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.2" y="5" width="17.6" height="15.8" rx="2"/><path d="M8 3v3.6M16 3v3.6M3.2 10h17.6"/><path d="M9.3 15.6l2 2 3.6-3.8"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Follow-ups</h3>
          <p>Run scheduled reminders and email sequences that pause automatically on reply.</p>
          <span class="rc-card-cue" aria-hidden="true">See inbox automation &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="rc-card rc-card-link" href="#access">
          <span class="rc-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4v15.4h16"/><path d="M8.2 16v-4.6M12.2 16V8.4M16.2 16v-6.4"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Reports</h3>
          <p>Spot stalled leads, review pipeline value, and see what needs your attention today.</p>
          <span class="rc-card-cue" aria-hidden="true">Try it free &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rc-spotlight rc-spotlight-leads" id="lead-deal-management" aria-labelledby="leads-title">
    <div class="wrap rc-spotlight-grid">
      <div class="rc-spotlight-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">LEAD &amp; DEAL MANAGEMENT</span>
        <h2 id="leads-title">Stop losing warm leads in spreadsheets and sticky notes.</h2>
        <p class="rc-section-intro">Import spreadsheets in seconds, separate active buyers and sellers into dedicated workspaces, and keep every transaction stage visible.</p>
        <ul class="rc-editorial-list">
          <li class="rc-editorial-item">
            <h3><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3.5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8.5z"/><path d="M14 3.5v5h5"/><path d="M9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg>CSV, Excel &amp; Google Sheets Import</h3>
            <p>Upload CSV or Excel files with automatic column mapping and import history, or connect Google Sheets to bring new leads straight into your CRM.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rc-editorial-item">
            <h3><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10.5L12 4l9 6.5"/><path d="M5 9.5V19a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9.5"/><path d="M9.5 20v-6h5v6"/></svg>Buyer &amp; Seller Workspaces</h3>
            <p>Switch between Buyers, Sellers, and Past Clients to review showings, active listings, preferred neighborhoods, and upcoming follow-up dates.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="rc-editorial-item">
            <h3><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="5.5" height="16" rx="1.2"/><rect x="10.25" y="4" width="5.5" height="11" rx="1.2"/><rect x="17.5" y="4" width="3.5" height="14" rx="1.2"/></svg>Visual Deal &amp; Property Pipeline</h3>
            <p>Move opportunities across customizable stages, link properties to contacts, and track expected net commission as deals progress toward closing.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="rc-shot">
        <div class="rc-shot-frame">
          <img
            src="crm-leads-contacts.webp"
            alt="RealtorCRM Contacts workspace showing 11 buyer, seller, investor, and referral partner leads with stage, temperature tags, next follow-up dates, and unified search and filter controls"
            width="1280"
            height="800"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption>Contacts workspace with Buyer &amp; Seller tabs, unified filters, and file import.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rc-spotlight rc-spotlight-followup" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="followup-title">
    <div class="wrap rc-spotlight-grid rc-spotlight-grid-flip">
      <figure class="rc-shot rc-shot-left">
        <div class="rc-shot-frame">
          <img
            src="crm-followup-automation.webp"
            alt="RealtorCRM Follow-up automation screen showing active sequences with trigger rules, timezone settings, and stop-on-reply and stop-on-unsubscribe toggles"
            width="1280"
            height="800"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <figcaption>Follow-up sequences with trigger rules and automatic stop-on-reply protection.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="rc-spotlight-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">FOLLOW-UPS &amp; EMAIL COMMUNICATION</span>
        <h2 id="followup-title">Follow up consistently — and step in the moment they reply.</h2>
        <p class="rc-section-intro">Pair reusable email templates with automated sequences, connect Gmail or Outlook, and stay in control of every conversation.</p>
        <ol class="rc-timeline">
          <li class="rc-timeline-item">
            <span class="rc-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Connect Gmail or Outlook</h3>
              <p>Link your personal Gmail or Microsoft Outlook mailbox — or a shared team mailbox — with automatic built-in fallback delivery if a connected mailbox is unavailable.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="rc-timeline-item">
            <span class="rc-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Trigger Templates &amp; Sequences</h3>
              <p>Build reusable plain-text email templates and multi-step sequences triggered by new leads, stage changes, stale contacts, or scheduled follow-up dates.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="rc-timeline-item">
            <span class="rc-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Auto-Stop on Reply or Unsubscribe</h3>
              <p>RealtorCRM monitors reply and unsubscribe signals and stops the sequence for that contact automatically so you can step in personally.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rc-faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</span>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Quick answers before you jump in.</h2>
      <dl class="rc-faq-grid">
        <div class="rc-faq-item">
          <dt>Is RealtorCRM free during early access?</dt>
          <dd>Yes. RealtorCRM is free during early access so you can organize contacts, deals, tasks, and automated follow-ups without a credit card.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-faq-item">
          <dt>Can I import my existing contacts from CSV, Excel, or Google Sheets?</dt>
          <dd>Yes. Upload CSV or Excel spreadsheets with automatic column mapping, or connect Google Sheets to bring your active buyer and seller list straight in.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-faq-item">
          <dt>Do automated follow-ups send from my own Gmail or Outlook?</dt>
          <dd>Yes. Connect your Gmail or Outlook mailbox so replies land directly in your inbox, with built-in fallback delivery if a connected mailbox is unavailable.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-faq-item">
          <dt>Does it work on my phone without an app-store download?</dt>
          <dd>Yes. RealtorCRM runs cleanly in any mobile browser and can be installed directly to your home screen as a lightweight web app.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rc-cta-section" id="access" aria-labelledby="access-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="rc-cta">
        <h2 id="access-title">Your next opportunity starts with better follow-up.</h2>
        <p>Stay organized, respond with clarity, and keep your real estate work moving. RealtorCRM is free during early access — organize your contacts, deals, tasks, and follow-ups in one place.</p>
        <div class="rc-actions rc-cta-actions">
          <a class="btn rc-btn-light" href="#access" data-crm-link="signup">Get Started with RealtorCRM</a>
          <a class="btn rc-btn-ghost" href="#features">Explore All Features</a>
        </div>
        <p class="rc-access-note">Sign up or log in in the RealtorCRM app — your account and workspace are created there. This website never asks for your password.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
